### Purpose: provides read-only checks for the directly launched backend API.
### Main requests: liveness, dependency readiness, anti-forgery token, and plan catalogue.
### Under Aspire, use the API URL displayed by the dashboard.

@ParishLife.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7243

GET {{ParishLife.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{ParishLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{ParishLife.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{ParishLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/plans
Accept: application/json

###
